  "That backup is empty.": "Ta sigurnosna kopija je prazna.",
  "That backup is in format {version}, which this build doesn't know how to read.": "Ta sigurnosna kopija je u formatu {version}, koji ova verzija ne zna pročitati.",
  "That doesn't look like a URL. Paste an addon link, or one starting with https://": "To ne izgleda kao URL. Zalijepi poveznicu dodatka ili onu koja počinje s https://",
  "That file isn't JSON, so it isn't a backup.": "Ta datoteka nije JSON, pa nije ni sigurnosna kopija.",
